<title>USA: U.S. business loans fell $6.1 bln in April 2 week.</title>
<headline>U.S. business loans fell $6.1 bln in April 2 week.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commercial and industrial loans on the books of U.S. commercial banks fell $6.1 billion to $800.4 billion in the week ended April 2, the Federal Reserve said on Friday.</p>
</text>
